                <p>
                    @(isEn
                        ? "Let's review your current systems, technical debt and operational constraints to define a modernization roadmap that is realistic, incremental and measurable."
                        : "Analizziamo sistemi attuali, debito tecnico e vincoli operativi per definire una roadmap di modernizzazione realistica, incrementale e misurabile.")
                </p>

                <a href="@(isEn ? "/en/contact" : "/contatti")"
                   class="btn btn-primary">

                    @(isEn
                        ? "Request an architecture review"
